			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Fixed Golden Oak Log dropping zero stack golden ambers\n* Fix some weapons not extending TemplateSwordItem, fixing some mod compatibility issues\n* Add keybind to give lore books\n* Make lava turn into aerogel in aether\n* Make fire in aether behaviour more consistent\n* Fix Sun Spirit crash in singleplayer, also fix some textures not showing\n* Fix Slider sleeping while attacking\n* Fix dart shooters damaging owners when attempting to shoot them\n* Fix Slider dropping invalid id blocks, also prevent Slider from being affected by liquids\n* Added cloud staff to bronze dungeon loot\n* Make frozen balls animate, also change damage as it makes final boss too easy when compared to original\n* Fix lighting killing servers\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/matthewperiut/aether-fabric-b1.7.3/compare/1.5.1...1.6.0"
		},
