			"notes": "Last version that will support stapi alpha.1.x to alpha 5.x, includes many community fixes, thank you @Kaosreven \nNext version is alpha.6.x only and beyond (depending on changes in later versions of stapi).\n\n## What's Changed\n* Fix some block and entity item drop IDs by @telvarost in https://github.com/matthewperiut/aether-fabric-b1.7.3/pull/28\n* Multiple fixes for the mod by @Kaosreven in https://github.com/matthewperiut/aether-fabric-b1.7.3/pull/29\n* Another batch of fixes by @Kaosreven in https://github.com/matthewperiut/aether-fabric-b1.7.3/pull/30\n* Update to latest accessory api\n* Made Sheepuffs accept any shear item for shearing by @Kaosreven\n* Made zephyr and cockatrice spawns more consistent by @Kaosreven\n* Fix Zephyr snowball invalid texture by @Kaosreven\n* Prevent flaming arrow entity from spawning fire in Aether by @Kaosreven\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Kaosreven made their first contribution in https://github.com/matthewperiut/aether-fabric-b1.7.3/pull/29\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/matthewperiut/aether-fabric-b1.7.3/compare/1.4.0...1.4.2"
